The adapted pieces are the tmux-backed interactive Claude Code launch,
transcript tailing, terminal stop detection, screen-idle fallback, and
Claude Code version fallback strategy. cladup changes the interface contract:
it is a full Claude CLI shim for npx/GitHub usage, and only intercepts
-p/--print invocations.
